    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Return of spontaneous circulation (ROSC) is not the end of resuscitation - it is the beginning of a critical post-arrest stabilization phase. Post-cardiac arrest syndrome encompasses global ischemia-reperfusion injury affecting the brain, myocardium, & all organ systems. Systematic, protocolized intensive care is required to optimize survival & neuro outcomes."
     }
    ]
